1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,392
Psst! What glows at night?

2
00:00:02,642 --> 00:00:04,046
Can you guess?

3
00:00:06,046 --> 00:00:08,979
Let's find out at our sleepover, Pip!

4
00:00:09,529 --> 00:00:11,429
My very first sleepover!

5
00:00:11,429 --> 00:00:12,414
Woof, woof!

6
00:00:14,264 --> 00:00:15,448
Pajamas on.

7
00:00:15,448 --> 00:00:16,885
Teeth brushed.

8
00:00:17,135 --> 00:00:19,587
Time for bed, little ones.

9
00:00:20,137 --> 00:00:21,810
Night night, lamp!

10
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:22,960
Click!

11
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,752
Oh! It's very dark now.

12
00:00:27,302 --> 00:00:30,110
Hmm. I'm not sure I like the dark.

13
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,205
That's okay, Pip.

14
00:00:32,205 --> 00:00:33,596
I'm right here.

15
00:00:33,846 --> 00:00:37,026
Let's look for the cosy lights of the night!

16
00:00:38,876 --> 00:00:39,695
Ooh, look!

17
00:00:39,695 --> 00:00:42,780
A big shape on the wall, with long, long ears!

18
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,434
Who could it be?

19
00:00:46,434 --> 00:00:47,194
It's me!

20
00:00:47,194 --> 00:00:48,438
It's my shadow!

21
00:00:48,438 --> 00:00:49,682
Wiggle, wiggle!

22
00:00:51,532 --> 00:00:52,324
My turn!

23
00:00:52,324 --> 00:00:54,628
Floppy ears and a waggy tail.

24
00:00:54,878 --> 00:00:56,493
Who is this shadow?

25
00:00:58,493 --> 00:00:59,411
It's Pip!

26
00:00:59,411 --> 00:01:00,481
Woof, woof!

27
00:01:01,031 --> 00:01:03,512
Shadows are silly, not scary!

28
00:01:05,362 --> 00:01:07,186
Pip, look out the window!

29
00:01:07,186 --> 00:01:08,945
Who is glowing up there?

30
00:01:10,945 --> 00:01:12,064
Hello, Pip!

31
00:01:12,064 --> 00:01:13,343
I'm the Moon.

32
00:01:13,343 --> 00:01:14,702
I glow softly,

33
00:01:14,702 --> 00:01:16,141
all night long.

34
00:01:16,691 --> 00:01:17,729
Hello, Moon!

35
00:01:17,729 --> 00:01:19,114
You look so cosy.

36
00:01:20,964 --> 00:01:22,949
What shape am I tonight?

37
00:01:22,949 --> 00:01:25,817
Draw it in the air with your finger!

38
00:01:27,817 --> 00:01:28,650
A circle!

39
00:01:28,650 --> 00:01:30,663
Round and round and round!

40
00:01:32,513 --> 00:01:35,503
Count my stars with me, Pip!

41
00:01:36,053 --> 00:01:36,822
One!

42
00:01:37,822 --> 00:01:38,553
Two!

43
00:01:40,853 --> 00:01:41,699
Three!

44
00:01:42,699 --> 00:01:43,507
Four!

45
00:01:45,807 --> 00:01:47,312
And one more,

46
00:01:47,312 --> 00:01:48,723
way up high!

47
00:01:48,973 --> 00:01:52,331
How many stars are there now?

48
00:01:54,331 --> 00:01:56,927
Five! Five twinkly stars!

49
00:01:58,777 --> 00:02:02,143
Let's make twinkle fingers, like stars!

50
00:02:02,393 --> 00:02:05,228
Open, close, open, close!

51
00:02:07,228 --> 00:02:08,606
Twinkle, twinkle!

52
00:02:08,606 --> 00:02:10,536
My paws are little stars!

53
00:02:12,386 --> 00:02:14,186
Hoo... hoo...

54
00:02:14,486 --> 00:02:15,559
What was that?

55
00:02:15,559 --> 00:02:17,390
Who says hoo-hoo at night?

56
00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:21,962
Let's peek outside together.

57
00:02:22,212 --> 00:02:24,275
Stay close to me.

58
00:02:26,125 --> 00:02:29,069
Hoo-hoo! Good evening, Pip!

59
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:31,352
It's me, Ollie Owl!

60
00:02:31,902 --> 00:02:33,652
Ollie! You're awake?

61
00:02:34,202 --> 00:02:36,297
Owls are awake at night.

62
00:02:36,297 --> 00:02:38,081
We sleep in the day!

63
00:02:39,931 --> 00:02:43,257
Look! Little lights are blinking in the grass.

64
00:02:43,507 --> 00:02:45,200
Blink, blink!

65
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:47,562
Those are fireflies!

66
00:02:47,562 --> 00:02:49,138
Their tails glow.

67
00:02:49,388 --> 00:02:51,444
What colour is their light?

68
00:02:53,444 --> 00:02:55,906
Yellow! A soft yellow glow!

69
00:02:57,756 --> 00:03:00,770
Can I tell you a secret, Pip?

70
00:03:01,020 --> 00:03:01,813
The big,

71
00:03:01,813 --> 00:03:05,132
bright day is too sunny for my sleepy eyes!

72
00:03:05,682 --> 00:03:08,547
Really? You feel a little unsure too?

73
00:03:09,097 --> 00:03:12,039
Yes! So I snuggle in my cosy tree,

74
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:14,027
and then I feel brave.

75
00:03:14,577 --> 00:03:16,294
I can find my cosy too!

76
00:03:16,294 --> 00:03:17,615
Thank you, Ollie!

77
00:03:19,465 --> 00:03:22,548
I have a little something for you, Pip.

78
00:03:22,798 --> 00:03:24,526
A star night light,

79
00:03:24,526 --> 00:03:25,783
all your own.

80
00:03:26,333 --> 00:03:27,636
Can I turn it on?

81
00:03:27,636 --> 00:03:29,199
Ready? Count with me.

82
00:03:29,449 --> 00:03:31,103
One, two, three!

83
00:03:33,103 --> 00:03:33,703
Click!

84
00:03:35,303 --> 00:03:37,075
Wow! My star is glowing!

85
00:03:37,075 --> 00:03:39,437
The dark feels soft and cosy now.

86
00:03:39,987 --> 00:03:42,438
Now you have a little star inside,

87
00:03:42,438 --> 00:03:44,160
and a big moon outside!

88
00:03:46,010 --> 00:03:48,260
I made a Night Light Song!

89
00:03:48,510 --> 00:03:50,030
Sing it with me!

90
00:03:50,580 --> 00:03:51,522
Glow, glow,

91
00:03:51,522 --> 00:03:53,003
little night light.

92
00:03:53,253 --> 00:03:54,628
Soft and yellow,

93
00:03:54,628 --> 00:03:56,003
warm and bright.

94
00:03:56,553 --> 00:03:57,964
Moon is round,

95
00:03:57,964 --> 00:03:59,623
and stars say hi.

96
00:03:59,873 --> 00:04:01,379
Fireflies blink,

97
00:04:01,379 --> 00:04:02,885
and owls fly by.

98
00:04:03,435 --> 00:04:04,378
Glow, glow,

99
00:04:04,378 --> 00:04:05,858
little night light.

100
00:04:06,108 --> 00:04:08,820
Cosy, cosy, sleepy night.

101
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:13,390
Let's do sleepy puppy breaths.

102
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,316
Breathe in slowly,

103
00:04:15,316 --> 00:04:17,790
like smelling a warm cookie.

104
00:04:19,790 --> 00:04:21,223
And breathe out,

105
00:04:21,223 --> 00:04:23,334
like blowing a dandelion.

106
00:04:23,584 --> 00:04:25,161
Whoosh.

107
00:04:27,161 --> 00:04:28,849
Stretch your arms up,

108
00:04:28,849 --> 00:04:29,904
like a star.

109
00:04:30,154 --> 00:04:31,834
Now curl up small,

110
00:04:31,834 --> 00:04:33,674
like a sleepy puppy.

111
00:04:35,674 --> 00:04:37,981
Yawn. I'm a sleepy puppy.

112
00:04:39,831 --> 00:04:41,002
Goodnight, Moon.

113
00:04:41,002 --> 00:04:42,235
Goodnight, Ollie.

114
00:04:42,485 --> 00:04:44,754
Goodnight, little night light.

115
00:04:45,304 --> 00:04:46,810
Goodnight, Pip.

116
00:04:46,810 --> 00:04:49,152
I'll glow all night long.

117
00:04:49,702 --> 00:04:52,164
Can you whisper goodnight too?

118
00:04:55,464 --> 00:04:56,634
One more time!

119
00:04:56,634 --> 00:04:58,906
Make twinkle fingers and sing!

120
00:04:59,156 --> 00:05:00,098
Glow, glow,

121
00:05:00,098 --> 00:05:01,579
little night light.

122
00:05:01,829 --> 00:05:04,541
Cosy, cosy, sleepy night.

123
00:05:05,341 --> 00:05:09,209
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

124
00:05:09,809 --> 00:05:10,728
Next time,

125
00:05:10,728 --> 00:05:12,851
Pip Puppy has a chilly day,

126
00:05:12,851 --> 00:05:14,549
and a big, big achoo!

127
00:05:15,149 --> 00:05:16,757
Woof! Goodnight, friends!

128
00:05:16,757 --> 00:05:19,111
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
